- "task:B104": {
-  "evidence_line": "Producer: scripts/has_the_ticket_store_earned_its_place_2026-11-03.py",
-  "options": [
-   "**The spoken file cites the short code; the written twin cites the short code beside the full identifier. This is the recommendation.** He gets a reference he can speak and quote back, a machine reading the twin gets the digest, and an issue with no entry yet gets an entry raised, which is what the list is for.",
