-  "evidence_line": "Over 3000 replications, 1 in 20 wrongly demotes a healthy model 3.50 per cent of the time against 1.57 per cent at 1 in 50, a factor of 2.2340, Fisher exact p = 2.171e-06, at a cost of 4.63 points of detection. The rule itself is connected to nothing, so this changes no behaviour today.",
